  "description": "\"Seren\" comes from the word serendipity which in short means the act of finding something valuable or delightful when you are not looking for it-that sounds a lot like love to us. Seren 3 is simple, elegant, and beautiful. She's lightweight thanks to her aluminum construction and equipped with a 3 speed hub and twist shifter provides you with low, medium, and high gearing, which is just what you need to get around town and nothing you don't. 700c tires and rims, 14g rust free stainless steel spokes, and full coverage fenders, chain guard, and a color matched rear carrier standard.\nLightweight D-Street 6061 aluminum frame with classic comfort geometry\nSturdy rigid hi-ten comfort fork\nShimano Nexus 3 speed internal hub with Revo twist shifter\nAlloy stem and lightweight comfortable handlebars\nCustom D Street Comfort Retro saddle with matching grips\nLightweight 32-hole alloy wheelset with doublewall rims\nCustom D Street full-coverage fenders and chain guard\nColor-matched rack",
